# Notifications (MVP)

Channels:

1. **PWA push** (in-app + web push)
2. **WhatsApp** via team `whatsapp_notify_url` webhook
   - Group fan-outs: `{ text }`
   - Individual reminders: `{ text, phones: string[] }` (E.164 from profiles)

## Triggers

| When | What |
|------|------|
| Match confirmed | Ask players to vote availability + carpool |
| Daily **12:00** & **21:00** IST until match day − 1 | If strength &lt; 11, remind non-voters (in-app + individual WA) |
| Each pre-freeze 13th+ yes vote | Alert Admin only; no squad fan-out |
| Vote flips yes → no | Ask others if available |
| Match day − 1 at **18:00** IST | Finalize + notify at 11–12; invalid strength waits for Admin |
| Admin confirms 11–12 | In-app + WhatsApp squad-final notification |
| Match day **14:00** IST | Admin-only: assign carpool rides (in-app + individual WA) |
| Sunday **19:00** IST | One weekend payment notification (Sat, Sun, or both) |
| Admin edits frozen poll | Re-notify participation changes |
| Admin fund ask | ₹300 contribution request |

## Implementation notes

- Prefer scheduled jobs (Supabase Cron / Edge Functions) in **Asia/Kolkata**
- Persist notification rows for in-app inbox
- **Web Push:** members enable in Settings; subscriptions in `push_subscriptions`;
  `broadcastTeamNotificationAction` + Cron (`APP_URL` → `/api/internal/push`)
  send OS notifications when the PWA is backgrounded. Foreground uses Realtime
  + Crease chime (no duplicate OS banner).
- Never block core mutations if WhatsApp or Web Push delivery fails — log and retry
- RLS: members read only their own rows; only Admin may insert from a session
- Team fan-out from the app goes through `broadcastTeamNotificationAction`
  (Server Action → membership re-check → service-role **batch** insert)
- Never loop per-member notification inserts from a browser service
- Player-triggered fan-out (availability flip) is fire-and-forget — do not make
  the voter wait on it
